{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44790","headline":"别盛安 · 护国","name":"别盛安","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"情人取次几淹留，别後南州与北州。\n月色爲怜今夜客，砧声那似去年秋。\n欲除豺虎论三略，莫对云山咏四愁。\n亲故相逢且借问，古来无种是王侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"护国","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44790.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44790","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}